# Desktop with a pattern CONTROL.INI does not list (WIN.INI [Desktop] Pattern=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8, also on
# the desktop) and a wallpaper that does not exist: OK shows message 215 (the settings before the
# wallpaper are written already), then Cancel. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-nowall.scn
# (reference run with -WinIni 'Desktop/Pattern=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8').
# Desktop is the third icon here (Ports, Mouse, Desktop, ...); real 3.11 has it fifth (index 4).
# Run with ARCH311_INI_DIR=<folder with that WIN.INI>: tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-nowall.w16 OUT
sleep 600
key right
key right
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
type nofile.bmp
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/02-typed.png
key enter
sleep 500
shot shots/03-message.png
key enter
sleep 300
shot shots/04-back.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/05-closed.png
quit
